WEBVTT

00:07.690 --> 00:09.110
Here we are!

00:09.110 --> 00:13.280
Look, everyone! This is the legendary onsen where maniacs cry and dance insanely with joy,

00:13.280 --> 00:14.740
Kumagoroshi Onsen!

00:14.740 --> 00:22.360
You shall all cry with joy that I brought you here to take in the grace of great Mother Nature!

00:22.360 --> 00:24.250
Yes, yes. Thank you very much.

00:26.600 --> 00:29.240
Father, don't let go of my hand, okay?

00:29.240 --> 00:30.710
If you do, everything will turn into bee hives.

00:30.710 --> 00:34.090
Look, everyone. Hyouka is being adorable.

00:34.090 --> 00:36.530
Look at how embarrassed he is.

00:36.530 --> 00:38.970
Can't help it. He hasn't seen her in a while.

00:38.970 --> 00:40.970
Let's go knock on the door.

00:42.310 --> 00:43.140
We shall.

00:43.140 --> 00:44.640
Anyone home?!

00:44.640 --> 00:47.860
Kyouka-sama and her family frenzy have arrived!

00:47.860 --> 00:49.570
We've come since you insisted we do!

00:50.860 --> 00:52.110
Welcome!

00:52.490 --> 00:53.540
Kiriko-san!

00:55.550 --> 00:56.990
Hyouka-yan.

02:16.430 --> 02:17.690
Klutzy girls, failure girls, bean sprout girls.

02:17.690 --> 02:19.020
Our worrier is a glasses girl!

02:19.020 --> 02:20.570
Add a "girl" to the end, and they all become a moe factor!

02:20.570 --> 02:21.750
I object to that kind of world!

02:21.750 --> 02:24.330
And I'm the cute absolute god, Kyouka-sama!

02:44.800 --> 02:46.160
Where's our room?

02:46.160 --> 02:48.050
Drop our bags and it's time for food!

02:48.050 --> 02:50.880
Tonight will literally be a party! A feast!

02:50.880 --> 02:55.400
Ginichi-san, I heard the onsen here is a rare one called a radioactive onsen.

02:55.400 --> 02:56.150
I can hardly wait.

02:56.150 --> 02:58.860
Hey everyone! Tidy yourselves up.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.410
Radioactive.

03:09.410 --> 03:11.090
Yeah, go go!

03:14.840 --> 03:15.610
Sing!

03:15.610 --> 03:16.350
Drink!

03:16.350 --> 03:17.590
Dance!

03:17.590 --> 03:21.150
We're going to have fun tonight!

03:21.150 --> 03:25.630
Um, but is it really all right for this many of us to come?

03:25.630 --> 03:28.860
Yeah, no prob. It's offseason, so we're bored.

03:30.190 --> 03:33.560
By the looks of it, you seem to be alone here.

03:33.560 --> 03:38.780
That's 'cause everyone, including the proprietress, got taken to the hospital for food poisoning.

03:40.690 --> 03:42.530
Food poisoning?

03:43.010 --> 03:46.240
Those came in this morning,
so I don't think there's a problem.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.280
I see...

03:47.280 --> 03:50.630
Congrats, Ginka. Now relax and check for poison.

03:51.040 --> 03:52.920
Why me?!

03:52.920 --> 03:55.330
Mother, you shouldn't be too rash.

03:58.900 --> 04:01.120
Yes, I can hear them.

04:05.800 --> 04:11.140
I can hear the foolish humans' voices, enjoying the night not even knowing what will happen later.

04:14.940 --> 04:17.060
Hey, Klutz Devil, are we really doing this?

04:17.060 --> 04:19.210
Of course we are!

04:19.210 --> 04:21.240
I'm a devil, you know!

04:22.610 --> 04:26.490
If I hear there's a death in the west,
I go grab the soul before it ascends to the heavens.

04:26.580 --> 04:31.700
If I hear there's someone half-dead in the east,
I grab the soul away, telling them they'll die soon.

04:32.450 --> 04:35.730
That's right! The current devils are all cruel and merciless.

04:35.730 --> 04:39.630
We're members of the special force that went through training to steal souls!

04:39.630 --> 04:41.730
I want to fight on the frontline, too.

04:41.730 --> 04:42.910
I want to be honored!

04:42.910 --> 04:43.720
Yet!

04:43.720 --> 04:50.780
While my colleagues go through grand debuts, I alone have to clean the Demon Lord's bedroom day after day as punishment!

04:50.780 --> 04:53.020
How can one bear this kind of treatment?!

04:53.020 --> 04:57.020
Bear with it or not, it's all because you're a klutz.

04:57.020 --> 04:58.140
Shut up!

04:58.140 --> 04:59.500
Say no more!

04:59.500 --> 05:04.740
In any case, today, I am getting a human soul no matter what and prove that I'm a fully-fledged devil now.

05:04.740 --> 05:08.410
Then I'll be freed from that ungrateful name!

05:09.720 --> 05:10.930
After all...

05:12.230 --> 05:18.380
I have the great words I found in the Lord's bedroom from the Hades Mirror.

05:18.380 --> 05:21.130
I know for a fact that someone will die here today.

05:21.130 --> 05:25.170
If I bring that person's soul back,
a wonderful devilish life will be waiting for me!

05:25.170 --> 05:27.220
True.

05:27.220 --> 05:29.890
But doesn't that sound like cheating?

05:29.890 --> 05:31.820
Shut up, Mike.

05:31.820 --> 05:33.930
Results are all that matters in this world.

05:33.930 --> 05:36.740
If you're my familiar, then help me out a little.

05:36.740 --> 05:38.180
Don't wanna. Pain in the butt.

05:38.180 --> 05:42.400
I shouldn't have made a sloth my familiar just because it'd be unique.

05:42.400 --> 05:44.230
Just make sure not to do anything stupid.

05:44.230 --> 05:46.370
You're such a worrywart, Mike.

05:46.370 --> 05:48.580
How could I make any stupid mistakes on an easy mission like this?

05:48.020 --> 05:49.200
Um.

05:49.600 --> 05:51.090
Um, excuse me.

05:51.390 --> 05:54.120
Yes, what is it, little girl?

05:54.120 --> 05:54.830
Did I fool her?

05:55.650 --> 05:58.710
Klutz Devil, I don't think so.

05:59.360 --> 06:01.320
Um, I want to use the bathroom.

06:01.320 --> 06:02.960
What? Bathroom?

06:03.510 --> 06:08.050
Ah, I see. I was in the way, and you couldn't get in.

06:08.050 --> 06:09.470
Please go right ahead.

06:09.470 --> 06:10.890
Thank you.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.770
Looks like I managed to fool her.

06:14.770 --> 06:19.020
She's pretty good to stand behind me without having me realize she's there.

06:19.020 --> 06:19.520
You think?

06:19.520 --> 06:22.860
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Forget the minor details!

06:23.810 --> 06:25.150
So what are you going to do?

06:25.150 --> 06:26.420
Obviously...

06:28.490 --> 06:31.450
I'll first check her out.

06:31.450 --> 06:36.160
A capable devil has to narrow down who's the one likely to die.

06:36.160 --> 06:38.960
You look more like a capable pervert.

06:51.430 --> 06:53.980
Gosh, Ginichi-san.

06:53.980 --> 06:56.040
You should cut it out now, Kyouka.

06:56.580 --> 06:58.780
Oh, where did Yuuka go?

07:00.030 --> 07:03.370
Mike, what do you think was that about?

07:03.960 --> 07:05.440
She was crying.

07:05.900 --> 07:12.020
I'm not sure, but she could be the someone that's going to die at the onsen.

07:12.020 --> 07:15.020
Maybe she has a chronic disease and was crying from the pain.

07:15.020 --> 07:17.620
Even so, a young girl like her, of all the possibilities?

07:17.620 --> 07:20.150
Kid or not, death will come when it comes.

07:20.150 --> 07:21.620
That's what destiny is.

07:21.620 --> 07:23.930
I might still be able to help her, though.

07:23.930 --> 07:28.260
Or maybe, if I chase her out of the onsen, she might not have to die!

07:28.260 --> 07:31.400
If you did such a thing, you wouldn't be able to get the soul!

07:31.980 --> 07:33.720
Y-You're right...

07:33.720 --> 07:35.720
I'm a merciless devil.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.870
I mustn't be nice!

07:36.870 --> 07:38.340
I have to pull myself together.

07:38.870 --> 07:41.320
It's not like we know she's the one who's going to die.

07:41.320 --> 07:45.220
I have to understand the situation better to find out who's the one dying.

07:45.700 --> 07:46.960
Let's go, Mike!

07:55.060 --> 07:57.550
I thought I just bumped into a person...

07:57.550 --> 07:58.970
It must have been my imagination.

08:01.800 --> 08:04.540
L-L-L-L-Lion?

08:04.850 --> 08:06.320
Why is it talking?

08:07.000 --> 08:08.710
More importantly, we've got to scout.

08:08.710 --> 08:10.260
I know.

08:11.460 --> 08:12.510
What's this?

08:22.010 --> 08:24.600
You're hopeless, Ginichi-san.

08:24.600 --> 08:29.230
I will turn you into a man, manlier than Kitty.

08:27.380 --> 08:29.250
Calm down, Chika-chan.

08:30.540 --> 08:32.110
Wh-What is this...

08:32.110 --> 08:33.770
What a sight.

08:36.250 --> 08:38.580
What's wrong with them?!

08:38.580 --> 08:41.670
A talking lion, an electric jellyfish, and a S&M couple.

08:41.670 --> 08:44.160
None of them look like they'll die.

08:51.690 --> 08:52.620
Mike...

08:53.740 --> 08:56.430
That's a biological weapon for killing people. No mistake.

08:56.430 --> 08:58.660
It's finally quiet.

08:58.660 --> 09:00.680
Yeah.

09:02.020 --> 09:05.140
I'm sorry that we're such a noisy family as usual.

09:05.140 --> 09:06.600
Are we causing any trouble?

09:06.600 --> 09:08.760
No, not at all.

09:08.760 --> 09:11.160
Feels like ya guys give me strength instead.

09:11.160 --> 09:14.920
Plus, I got to meet ya again.

09:17.610 --> 09:19.320
Kiriko-san, I'm...

09:19.320 --> 09:23.200
No! Don't say things at the spur of the moment!

09:23.710 --> 09:27.010
Once I figure things out, I promise I'll go back.

09:27.010 --> 09:28.540
So not until then. 'kay?

09:28.540 --> 09:30.010
Okay.

09:30.010 --> 09:31.590
I'll be waiting.

09:32.810 --> 09:33.910
Hyouka-yan...

09:36.590 --> 09:38.690
W-What's up with those two?

09:38.690 --> 09:40.550
Love that transcends race...

09:41.700 --> 09:44.270
I envy things like that!

09:44.270 --> 09:50.440
Yeah, they're a murderous biological weapon and a human! I'm sure there were lots of walls to climb over.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.520
No, I'm sure there is more than that.

09:52.520 --> 09:59.340
That girl must have some story she can't tell, like she knows a secret of a secret society and is getting chased by an assassin!

09:59.340 --> 10:01.820
Yet she patiently waits and nurtures the love.

10:01.820 --> 10:05.790
Damn it! That biological weapon looks scary but is pretty good.

10:06.320 --> 10:08.830
I hope they'll have a happy life.

10:10.900 --> 10:12.130
Hey...

10:13.070 --> 10:15.630
You carry all the burden in life, don't you?

10:15.630 --> 10:20.890
Why are you cleaning dishes at an onsen where you're supposed to be served?

10:20.890 --> 10:25.480
I can't do that. After all, we were invited here free of charge.

10:25.480 --> 10:28.720
Don't say that and let's play ping pong.

10:28.720 --> 10:30.020
Let's play strip janken!

10:30.020 --> 10:31.990
Everyone has to have a moment of losing one's mind on a trip.

10:31.990 --> 10:34.220
Stop, my lord~

10:35.450 --> 10:38.550
Don't mess around with me just because we're at an onsen!

10:38.550 --> 10:39.950
Boo boo! Four-eyes, boo!

10:40.510 --> 10:43.340
That took care of most things.

10:43.340 --> 10:45.730
I wonder if those two are getting along well.

10:45.730 --> 10:50.430
If their alone time increases with this, then cleaning up is a small task.

10:50.430 --> 10:52.770
Once we take the trash out, let's go take a bath.

10:52.230 --> 10:55.460
Why don't you help a little?

10:55.460 --> 10:57.960
N-No! Don't touch that!

10:57.960 --> 11:02.140
I must! If it's come down to this,
I must help out as the mother, as well.

11:02.140 --> 11:04.620
Is it this? Or do you prefer it being done this way?

11:09.250 --> 11:12.130
Everyone here is such a good person.

11:12.130 --> 11:15.130
Yet someone has to die?

11:15.130 --> 11:19.090
What are you going to do? You can't change their destinies.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.700
Go home acting like you didn't see anything?

11:21.700 --> 11:23.180
It wasn't an order given to you.

11:23.180 --> 11:25.410
Even if you went home empty-handed-

11:24.350 --> 11:27.870
No! I can't go home empty-handed after coming this far.

11:28.330 --> 11:28.910
But...

11:30.940 --> 11:34.540
Get a grip! It's no time to be swayed by emotion.

11:34.540 --> 11:37.720
I am part of the honorable special force.

11:37.720 --> 11:41.230
I will carry out my mission even if it means selling my soul to a devil!

11:41.230 --> 11:42.850
You are a devil.

11:43.680 --> 11:47.960
This is where people will see
if I'm a full-fledged devil or not!

11:47.960 --> 11:50.600
As you say, I can't change the destiny.

11:50.600 --> 11:52.890
So I'll do whatever it takes!

11:53.470 --> 11:55.370
What exactly are you thinking?

12:02.440 --> 12:04.830
I was wondering what you were going to do and...

12:04.830 --> 12:08.510
Hey, Klutz Devil, if you're thinking of peeping on
the men's bath and taking advantage of the mission,

12:08.510 --> 12:12.080
then I'll take a photo of you doing that
and send it to the Devil Times anonymously.

12:12.080 --> 12:14.030
Why would I do such a thing?!

12:14.030 --> 12:18.230
How dare you say that of a pure and innocent girl like me?

12:18.710 --> 12:21.730
We'll save our discussion regarding that for next time.

12:21.730 --> 12:23.690
You keep your mouth shut and watch.

12:23.690 --> 12:29.510
If anything were to happen, it's likely to be that weak-looking Yuuka-chan or the shady deputy proprietress.

12:29.510 --> 12:34.890
I see. So as a devil, you're going to make sure you witness one of them die.

12:34.890 --> 12:36.730
More than just witness.

12:36.730 --> 12:42.030
Since they're all going to Hell
with the time bomb I set in the bath.

12:42.670 --> 12:46.070
What? You're going to drag people who are not supposed to die into this?

12:46.070 --> 12:51.460
Well, isn't it too sad for only one member of such a close family to die?

12:51.460 --> 12:53.430
Think of the trouble to the others.

12:53.430 --> 12:59.050
Besides, taking the soul of an individual who's not supposed to die yet is prohibited by Article 49.

12:58.380 --> 13:01.230
No matter what you say, I've already made up my mind!

13:01.230 --> 13:03.780
This is what's good for that family.

13:03.780 --> 13:05.050
And for my good!

13:05.050 --> 13:10.570
If I take all of their souls back at once, I'll be the ace of the special force!

13:10.570 --> 13:13.350
I won't let anyone call me a klutz!

13:15.800 --> 13:17.560
Is this really going to work?

13:17.560 --> 13:19.640
Yes, it will. Trust me.

13:21.660 --> 13:22.660
But...

13:23.650 --> 13:26.840
Sorry having ya come all the way over, Kyouka-yan.

13:26.840 --> 13:30.480
It's fine. I'm usually bored with nothing to do.

13:30.480 --> 13:34.910
When it gets busy once in blue moon, it's things like beastmen cases and an adventure through Ouka's body.

13:36.030 --> 13:39.070
Sounds like ya're dragged into strange things as usual.

13:39.070 --> 13:41.380
But I'm used to it now.

13:41.380 --> 13:43.460
It's convincing hearing from ya.

13:43.460 --> 13:47.380
Hey, you're laughing at us, but you're not so unrelated.

13:47.380 --> 13:51.180
Since you might become
my little sister one day, Takanashi-san.

13:51.760 --> 13:56.180
Please, don't be so mean to me.

13:56.180 --> 13:59.030
So? How is it going?

13:59.030 --> 14:00.980
What's it like to have met Hyouka-chan after a while?

14:00.980 --> 14:08.680
Well... I said I'd have grown more and looked prettier by the next time we meet, but I didn't grow at all.

14:08.680 --> 14:10.240
Not my breasts, either.

14:13.230 --> 14:19.830
No fair! If Hyouka-yan's always seeing things like those,
I bet he thinks of me as a poor little thing!

14:19.830 --> 14:21.480
Chika-yan, ya're inhuman!

14:21.480 --> 14:23.130
Well said, Panchiko girl!

14:23.130 --> 14:25.210
What is with your active volcano-like breasts?

14:25.210 --> 14:31.430
At the Midarezaki, where average is the motto, those unnaturally large breasts are undoubtedly the lost land, Mu!

14:31.430 --> 14:34.220
I don't remember raising you to be someone like that.

14:34.220 --> 14:36.200
Your breast should sleep underwater, too.

14:36.200 --> 14:38.480
I'm getting yelled at for no reason.

14:38.480 --> 14:40.530
Your bourgeois breasts!

14:40.530 --> 14:43.470
I'll just suck the fat out of your breasts!

14:43.980 --> 14:49.390
No, stop! Even for you, this is unbelievable violence!

14:44.590 --> 14:47.570
Hand those indecent breasts over to me!

14:48.430 --> 14:51.990
They're unfriendly to the planet!

14:51.990 --> 14:54.440
Yes, keep at it.

14:54.440 --> 14:57.380
You only have now to have fun like that.

14:57.380 --> 15:01.360
Soon, the time bomb I set in that rock will explode.

15:01.360 --> 15:03.240
Yuuka-yan? Yuuka-yan?

15:03.240 --> 15:06.770
What's wrong? Ya don't look so well. Are ya feeling sick?

15:07.480 --> 15:08.800
No, I'm fine.

15:10.150 --> 15:12.470
Don't lie to me. Bad girl, Yuuka-yan.

15:12.470 --> 15:17.540
I understand ya don't want to make others worry, but keeping it inside ya is what idiots do.

15:17.840 --> 15:20.510
If ya're fine with me, I'll listen to anything.

15:20.510 --> 15:21.340
Yeah...

15:25.470 --> 15:28.740
It's 'cause ya're soaking so deep.

15:28.740 --> 15:30.880
Ya'll boil ya skin.

15:30.880 --> 15:33.250
Come cool down with me.

15:33.250 --> 15:34.760
Y-Yeah...

15:35.100 --> 15:39.200
But my body's covered with scars, so...

15:40.000 --> 15:42.120
Oh, I'm sorry.

15:42.840 --> 15:46.510
No, it's all right. The scars are slowly going away.

15:46.510 --> 15:49.030
What happened at the Himemiya is of the past, too.

15:49.030 --> 15:50.410
So I'm fine.

15:50.410 --> 15:52.510
I'm simply happy right now.

15:52.510 --> 15:53.860
But see.

15:54.180 --> 15:58.120
No one feels comfortable seeing these scars.

15:58.120 --> 16:01.560
We're at an onsen, yet I'd break the fun.

16:01.910 --> 16:03.100
Yuuka-yan...

16:03.100 --> 16:05.220
What a good girl ya are!

16:05.220 --> 16:08.220
Ya don't have to worry about such things!

16:08.610 --> 16:10.680
Takanashi-san, what's wrong?

16:10.680 --> 16:13.240
Don't call me like that. Call me Onee-yan, Yuuka-yan.

16:13.240 --> 16:15.430
Ya can call me Onee-yan.

16:15.430 --> 16:18.710
Lean on me, Yuuka-yan!

16:18.710 --> 16:20.100
Takanashi-san?

16:24.260 --> 16:27.050
No, I can't see what's in front of me.

16:27.050 --> 16:29.420
They're all such good people.

16:29.420 --> 16:32.020
And what am I doing here?

16:32.020 --> 16:33.690
Hey now, Klutz Devil?

16:33.690 --> 16:36.260
Not that I'm bragging, but I'm average.

16:36.260 --> 16:39.510
I don't have scars on my body,
and I've never experienced unfortunate love.

16:39.510 --> 16:45.220
Yet, I've come to this far onsen wishing to be
acknowledged by others and to have a better life...

16:45.220 --> 16:49.680
I can't! I can't complain about my current life!

16:49.680 --> 16:56.750
To ignore my klutziness, feel jealous of others, and not only that, but to set a time bomb to kill great people like them?

16:56.750 --> 16:57.570
Bomb?

17:01.410 --> 17:03.710
The time's running out! Everyone run!

17:05.200 --> 17:07.420
You're a peeper, aren't you? I need to punish you.

17:11.500 --> 17:12.510
What's that noise?

17:13.440 --> 17:14.510
Is that all?

17:14.510 --> 17:16.590
Run, Klutz Devil.

17:16.590 --> 17:18.390
Before that, I've got to take care of the bomb!

17:18.390 --> 17:20.740
Take a smoke bomb!

17:20.740 --> 17:22.360
You had such a thing in your boot?

17:22.360 --> 17:24.590
Not even spies or terrorists use them these days.

17:24.590 --> 17:25.940
Whatever! Gotta run!

17:26.690 --> 17:28.060
Ow.

17:30.120 --> 17:30.520
Wait!

17:33.160 --> 17:34.750
H-Hyouka-yan?

17:34.750 --> 17:36.530
No, it's not like that, Kiriko-san.

17:36.530 --> 17:38.830
There was a peeper, so-

17:39.450 --> 17:41.620
Ya're the peeper!

17:41.620 --> 17:42.990
What is going on?

17:44.480 --> 17:45.910
Ginichi-san?!

17:45.910 --> 17:47.290
Yahoo, Chika-chan.

17:47.290 --> 17:53.710
Sure, Ouka. If it's you, I don't mind letting you have a glimpse of my wonderful nakedness.

17:56.690 --> 17:57.840
Never should have.

17:58.610 --> 18:00.990
Why don't you get turned on a little!!!

18:06.720 --> 18:07.680
Good luck.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.820
You're great.

18:09.820 --> 18:10.920
You're cool.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.040
I have respect for you.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.900
Are you the peeper?

18:13.900 --> 18:15.680
No, I'm not.

18:15.680 --> 18:17.180
I am a devil, believe it or not.

18:17.180 --> 18:19.280
Now I've got to take this as far as possible.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.880
So wait...

18:26.700 --> 18:28.500
The "someone" is me?

18:28.370 --> 18:30.210
Grave: Klutz Devil

18:28.500 --> 18:33.120
N-No, I can't take this!

18:40.430 --> 18:42.910
Thank goodness. You've come to.

18:42.910 --> 18:43.510
Klutz Devil?

18:43.510 --> 18:46.200
Y-Yuuka-chan?

18:46.880 --> 18:47.670
Mike.

18:47.670 --> 18:49.140
Hey, where is this?

18:49.620 --> 18:51.810
You shouldn't move yet.

18:51.810 --> 18:54.630
We were taking turns taking care of you.

18:55.030 --> 18:55.990
What happened to the bomb?

18:57.570 --> 19:01.050
I slipped the gunpowder out
in the beginning so nothing happened.

19:01.740 --> 19:04.240
I had a bad feeling.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.570
You never had the resolution to do something like that.

19:06.570 --> 19:12.040
I wouldn't want my master to massacre humans on a whim.

19:12.040 --> 19:13.080
Mike...

19:13.850 --> 19:16.400
Oh, thank goodness.

19:16.400 --> 19:17.680
It's not good at all!

19:18.260 --> 19:22.130
You were trying to kill us, right?

19:22.910 --> 19:23.890
Well...

19:24.520 --> 19:25.780
I don't care about me!

19:26.180 --> 19:33.860
But not my family. If you kill anyone in my important family...

19:34.290 --> 19:37.300
I will... I will...

19:38.080 --> 19:40.020
I will never forgive you!

19:42.420 --> 19:44.310
Yuuka-chan?

19:44.310 --> 19:48.500
This girl's so strong because of the strange family she's got.

19:48.500 --> 19:50.720
You should find people like that, too.

19:50.720 --> 19:55.060
From now, you shouldn't try to win the lottery but try to take things a step at a time, yeah?

19:55.060 --> 19:58.400
Yeah. Sorry. I'm sorry, Yuuka-chan.

19:58.400 --> 20:00.670
It's all right, Onee-san.

20:03.660 --> 20:06.900
Time for a party! The night's still young!

20:09.640 --> 20:13.350
Thanks for your hospitality.

20:13.350 --> 20:16.940
Please come visit anytime ya like.

20:16.940 --> 20:21.860
Watch what you say, or else she'll really come again in no time.

20:21.860 --> 20:22.700
Ouka.

20:22.700 --> 20:25.870
When we go home, shall we sit and talk for a while?

20:25.870 --> 20:27.740
S-So, Kiriko-san...

20:28.900 --> 20:30.620
Take care of yaself, Hyouka-yan.

20:32.120 --> 20:34.350
Come on, let's get a move on.

20:34.350 --> 20:36.720
Ah~ Don't be so rough with me.

20:42.500 --> 20:43.720
Bye.

21:01.190 --> 21:03.520
All is well, all is well.

21:03.520 --> 21:05.870
Everything's good now.

21:05.870 --> 21:08.930
But wow, you can be useful once in a while.

21:08.930 --> 21:15.220
Since you took the gunpowder out of that bomb, you did it for the other bombs, too, right?

21:15.220 --> 21:16.740
What? Others?

21:16.740 --> 21:22.500
The bombs I set all around the inn
in case I failed to kill them at the bath.

21:23.240 --> 21:23.860
You did, right?

21:24.370 --> 21:25.300
What were you thinking?

21:47.780 --> 21:48.900
That's it...

21:49.390 --> 21:50.850
I'm done with my life.

22:02.610 --> 22:04.390
She's standing next to me, right?

22:04.390 --> 22:05.360
Yup.

23:40.330 --> 23:43.020
Himemiya Senko. That's my old name.

23:43.020 --> 23:45.590
Midarezaki Chika. That's my current name.

23:45.590 --> 23:47.610
And the new bonds that I've made.

23:47.610 --> 23:49.280
They're all important to me...

23:49.280 --> 23:51.280
So I will become strong!

23:51.860 --> 23:53.410
Next time: Vitamin C's Forest.
